술술 (Sulsul) is a modified fork of VoiceInk.

Original work: VoiceInk by Prakash Joshi (Pax)
Upstream: https://github.com/Beingpax/VoiceInk
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE). Copyright notices in the
source are kept. This fork does not grant any trademark rights in the VoiceInk name.

Modified by the maintainer of https://github.com/qaws81877/VoiceInk (2026).

Changes in this fork include:
- Rebranded the app as 술술 (product name Sulsul) with its own bundle ID, data folder, and Keychain service so it does not share data with VoiceInk.
- Removed the license, trial, and purchase system, including Polar.
- Stopped contacting the original author's servers (announcements, Sparkle appcast, GitHub star prompt, and related links).
- Removed the VoiceInk Refine local model and its XPC service. That model's license does not allow redistribution.
- Turned off iCloud dictionary sync that depended on the original iCloud container.
- Onboarding can skip the transcription-model download or use a Whisper model instead of requiring Parakeet.

Each person enters their own API keys. No API keys are bundled.
